From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Tue, 30 Jun 2026 12:41:50 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 05055/11362] [outer-loop] arc3_live_submit: capture per-game
 guid -> arcprize.org/replay link

Operator wanted the game->replay-URL table recorded with the run. The browser
viewer is https://arcprize.org/replay/<guid> keyed by the per-game session guid
(verified 200 OK, no login). replay_live() now returns the guid; each per_game
row carries guid + replay_url; output adds replay_base. Retrofitted this run's
artifact (c4704493 scorecard, 25 games) + wrote results/arc3_replay_links.md.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
